        "id": 1000283
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-03-21T16:40:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Either way we\u0027re copying the input explicitly from a const\u0026 or implicitly from a passing by value.\n\nIn this case we\u0027re assigning it back to the source so let\u0027s add an overload:\n\n`void ApplyLimitTiers(CombinedLimits* limits)` which does the in-place updates.\n\n`CombinedLimits ApplyLimitTiers(CombinedLimits limits)` can be rewritten as:\n```\nCombinedLimits ApplyLimitTiers(const CombinedLimits\u0026 limits) {\n    CombinedLimits limitsCopy \u003d limits;\n    ApplyLimitTiers(\u0026limitsCopy);\n    return limitsCopy;\n}\n```",
      "parentUuid": "18de9c6e_ce6d17a0",
